#   .  open        #  wall        O  pit        ^  spikes      H  high ground
#   A  Player A deploy slot       B  Player B deploy slot
#   any other letter = an enemy declared by a 'spawn' line below

id: as-04-rope-and-shield
number: 404
name: Rope and Shield
description: A gets a Threadcaster and a Wardbearer; B gets three attackers. A's job is to move the enemy and to stand in front of it, not to out-damage it.
design: Asymmetry 4 — one player is pure support.
design: A's whole roster is a rope and a shield. The shield is now an action rather than an aura, so every round A chooses between Spear Thrust's 6 damage across two tiles, weighted to the far one and Guard Stance's cover — it cannot do both. B's roster is the entire kill order.

spawn h = Husk
spawn l = Lobber
spawn n = Anchor

roster a: Threadcaster, Wardbearer
roster b: Vanguard, Archer, Archer

board:
  h.l..BB
  .^...BB
  O.....H
  .......
  H.....O
  A...^..
  AAh.n.h
